              "n": 1,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "# H18 adaptation readiness"
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "n": 3,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "H18 prepares a prospective single shared Mind/Type multitask LoRA experiment. It"
            },
            {
              "n": 4,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "does not train, download weights, submit jobs, or retain a learned quality adapter."
            },
            {
              "n": 5,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "Readiness is blocked by incompatible/missing data, not by a missing launch switch."
            },
            {
              "n": 6,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "n": 7,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "`experiments/adaptation/readiness-audit.json` is a deterministic audit of checked-in"
            },
            {
              "n": 8,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "bytes. It records source, protocol/contract, candidate, H14/H15 and media hashes;"
            },
            {
              "n": 9,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "rights evidence; split/family/language counts; and explicit hard stops. The audit"
            },
            {
              "n": 10,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "verifies all candidate media and original source identities and reconstructs each"
            },
            {
              "n": 11,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "original prompt and first-action label. This is an existing-artifact inventory,"
            },
            {
              "n": 12,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "not a general dataset validator or a license determination for outside material."
            },
            {
              "n": 13,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "The audit first pins the reviewed historical source, 58-row examples and media"
            },
            {
              "n": 14,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "manifest, H14 tasks/freeze/raw measured result, and H15 report/independent verification"
            },
            {
              "n": 15,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "record to source-controlled SHA-256 identities. The H15 independent record also binds"
            },
            {
              "n": 16,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "the original candidate manifest and examples. Each image must retain its canonical"
            },
            {
              "n": 17,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "`images/<original-task-id>.png` identity and the digest in that pinned media catalog."
            },
            {
              "n": 18,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "Updating paired hashes cannot admit replacement screenshots or rewritten measurements."
            },
            {
              "n": 19,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "Score recomputation remains a consistency check after historical identity verification."
            },
            {
              "n": 20,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "New data or evidence requires a separately reviewed snapshot; this audit cannot import it."
            },
            {
              "n": 21,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": ""
            },
            {
              "n": 22,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "The original source has 180 synthetic tasks: train 116, dev 32, test 32. Its candidate"
            },
            {
              "n": 23,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "contains 58 English train rows across eight workflow families. The converter excluded"
            },
            {
              "n": 24,
              "sign": "+",
              "text": "58 Arabic train records because image shaping was unqualified. Completions are"
            }
          ],
          "dropped": 50
        }
      ]
